{
  "dom_id": "step-144055",
  "name": "Attempting to Solve an Equation With No Solution",
  "problem": "So, we know that the following equation has no solution:\n\n$$\n\\vert x \\vert = -4\n$$\n\nLet's see what happens when we blindly apply the usual process of solving our equation:\n\n- if $|x| = x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x| & =-4 \\\\ x & =-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- if $|x| = -x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x| & =-4 \\\\ -x & =-4 \\\\ x & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the usual process has given us the \"solutions\" $x= {\\color{red}{-4}}$ and $x= {\\color{blue}{4}}.$ However, neither of these values satisfies the original equation!\n\nFor example, by substituting $x = {\\color{blue}{4}}$ into the original equation, we get a *false statement!*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|x| & =-4 \\\\ |4| & =-4 \\\\ 4 & =-4\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe key takeaway is that it's essential to check that the right-hand side is positive (or zero) *before* applying the usual solution process.",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-144055\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"144055\" steptype=\"tutorial\" contentid=\"8827\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-144055\" class=\"stepAnchor\" name=\"step-7\">Attempting to Solve an Equation With No Solution</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"144055\">?</div>\n            </div> \n\n            <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>So, we know that the following equation has no solution:</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"8.692ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 3742.6 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\"> \n\\vert x \\vert = -4 \n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-7C\" d